\section{Glossary of Terms}

\begin{description}
\item[Caballería] Cuban unit of land measurement, approximately 13.4 hectares or 33.2 acres.

\item[Escritura] Notarized deed or legal document.

\item[Finca] Farm or rural property.

\item[Folio] Page number in a registry book.

\item[Inscripción] Registry entry.

\item[Notaría] Notary office.

\item[Protocolo] Notarial protocol (bound collection of notarized documents).

\item[Registro de la Propiedad] Property Registry.

\item[Tomo] Volume in a registry.

\item[Urbanización] Residential development or subdivision.
\end{description}

